WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
The one piece manga just set up the biggest&nbsp;
challenge for Luffy and co in the story so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.540
far. As the crew is getting ready to leave the&nbsp;
laboratory on egg head island together with their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:15.540
newest crew member Dr. Vegapunk, admiral Kizaru&nbsp;
is about to arrive at the island with a massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:25.260
fleet of Marine war ships. And the narrator&nbsp;
says: 迫る、海軍本部最高戦力。。。Which literally means ‘The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:31.080
Marine Haeadquarter’s ultimate military power is&nbsp;
approaching’. And this could mean that we finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:36.240
get to see an admiral go all out for the very&nbsp;
first time in the story. That would mean that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:43.380
we finally see how strong the admirals truly are&nbsp;
and if the straw hats are powerful enough to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:49.680
on the strongest people in the Marines. But you&nbsp;
might be wondering, how did Kizaru get here so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.960
fast? Well as soon as Kizaru heard about the&nbsp;
straw hats being on the island, he immediately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:00.120
put one and one together and figured out that&nbsp;
the straw hats would try and rescue Vegapunk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:06.120
from the special agents sent by the government&nbsp;
to assassinate him. I think it’s very easy to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.280
underestimate Kizaru. he always looks like he&nbsp;
is the least motivated of all the admirals,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:17.220
who doesn’t take anything seriously. However&nbsp;
this couldn’t be further from the truth. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:22.680
have seen it many many times now, that Kizaru is&nbsp;
actually the most active out of all the marine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:28.680
admirals we have seen so far. Greenbull seems&nbsp;
to enjoy lying around and immediately retreated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:34.560
from Wano once he couldn’t easily dominate his&nbsp;
opponents anymore. Both Aokiji and Fujitora are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:39.360
always very careful in their actions, taking&nbsp;
circumstances and the people around them into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:45.300
account. And even Akainu is surprisingly&nbsp;
passive in his leadership. For instance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:50.880
he refuses to attack Wano, carefully considering&nbsp;
the Marine’s power and what a battle would mean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:58.140
for their forces. Kizaru is the only admiral&nbsp;
who is always eager to jump right into action.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:04.140
We have seen Akainu holding him back a number&nbsp;
of times now. Remember Kizaru was willing to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:10.860
go to Wano on his own and face 3 Yonko’s&nbsp;
at once. That takes some serious balls.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:14.280
And i actually want to explain&nbsp;
all the marine admirals in detail,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:19.560
so I will make a dedicated video about that, if&nbsp;
at least 1000 people subscribe until tomorrow.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:25.920
But going back to Kizaru, did you also notice&nbsp;
that he is clearly not really eager to take orders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:30.480
from Akainu? Because while Akainu is getting&nbsp;
briefed on the situation with Luffy and Lucci,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:35.520
he only then realizes that Vegapunk knew&nbsp;
about the government’s plan to kill him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:41.280
Meanwhile Kizaru had not only gotten that&nbsp;
information before the fleet admiral,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:46.860
but also already left with an entire army&nbsp;
without waiting for Akainu’s permission.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:52.680
And the manga literally says in Japanese: ‘The&nbsp;
Marine Haeadquarter’s ultimate military power is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:59.700
approaching’. Does Oda mean an admiral? Or does&nbsp;
he mean Kizaru specifically? Because it would be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:06.060
truly a bombshell if the strongest marine fighter&nbsp;
would turn out to be neither Akainu nor Aokiji,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:11.640
who both fought for the position of fleet&nbsp;
admiral, but actually Kizaru all along. Kizaru&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:15.780
himself at least seems to be quite confident&nbsp;
that he can stop the straw hats himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:21.900
either with sheer strength or he has something&nbsp;
up his sleeve that he’s bringing with him.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:27.720
So, will Luffy actually fight Kizaru? Will&nbsp;
we finally find out how strong an admiral&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:33.060
is at full strength? It’s possible. I think&nbsp;
there are 3 ways this could go: Option 1:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:38.880
Kizaru is about to attack the straw hats and&nbsp;
Vegapunk, but someone rescues the straw hats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:45.060
and allows them to get away. I think this&nbsp;
scenario is actually pretty likely. For one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:50.280
we now have Vegapunk with the crew and i would&nbsp;
be really surprised, if he didn’t have a bunch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:55.140
of tricks up his sleeve in his own laboratory,&nbsp;
that would allow the crew to escape the incoming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:59.640
fleet of warships. On top of that, you might&nbsp;
remember, that Kuma has started running away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:05.100
from the revolutionaries and has most likely&nbsp;
teleported himself towards where Luffy and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:10.200
daughter Bonney are. Because that happened exactly&nbsp;
the moment, when Vegapunk realized that the agents&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:16.800
of CP0 had infiltrated the island. So he could be&nbsp;
the one to safe the crew once again from Kizaru,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:22.740
like he did on Sabaody archipelago. Also by the&nbsp;
way, there are a lot of parallels with sabaody&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:28.860
and enis lobby during this arc. Cyborg Franky&nbsp;
vs cyborg vegapunk. The Ohara flashback during&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:36.300
enies lobby and the ohara flashback here. Lucci&nbsp;
vs Luffy. Sentomaru, Kizaru and Kuma vs the straw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:42.240
hats. This time Sentomaru, Kuma and the straw&nbsp;
hats against Kizaru. And there is also a real&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:47.580
chance that the revolutionary army might show&nbsp;
up again as well. After all, Dragon was chasing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:52.740
after Kuma trying to stop him from leaving again.&nbsp;
So the straw hats might just be able to escape&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:57.720
another time, and we’ll have to wait for their&nbsp;
battle against all the admirals for a bit longer.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:05.100
Option 2 here, is much less likely, but&nbsp;
my personal favorite. Since the crew is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:10.020
about to set sail and Kizaru is coming with&nbsp;
a fleet of ships, there’s a chance that we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:15.480
might get to see the first sea battle in the&nbsp;
history of one piece. I know it sounds crazy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:20.460
but even though one piece is a story about pirates&nbsp;
and marines sailing the giant oceans of the world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:28.080
we haven’t had a single real sea battle in the&nbsp;
entire story. The most we have gotten was the crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:34.260
being chased around, like on whole cake island.&nbsp;
So it would be truly refreshing to see some actual&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:39.720
ship vs ship battle for a change, which would&nbsp;
also give franky a real chance to show off his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:45.360
technology to Vegapunk. This would of course also&nbsp;
be a great opportunity for the straw hat grand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:52.800
fleet to arrive. Imagine the thousand sunny all&nbsp;
along facing a whole armada of marine war ships&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.800 --> 00:06:00.720
and then suddenly ships appearing behind them&nbsp;
on the horizon. It would also be a great chance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:06.000
to bring Harujin and his Giant crew into the&nbsp;
story again to guide the straw hats to Elbaf,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:12.900
which is most likely the next destination after&nbsp;
this. I don’t know how the fleet would know about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:17.940
the straw hat’s dangerous situation here, but&nbsp;
it would be truly awesome to see nonetheless.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:24.630
But option number 3 would be even better. And&nbsp;
that’s, that the straw hats actually have a all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:30.480
out battle with Kizaru and the other Marines. Now&nbsp;
it’s really hard to say how powerful Kizaru really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:37.320
is and if Luffy would be able to defeat him. Is&nbsp;
Kizaru stronger than Kaido? It seems unlikely,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:41.400
but then again, he was more than&nbsp;
eager to go to Wano and fight him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:48.240
Luffy and Big Mom. So who knows. But even if he&nbsp;
is a bit weaker than Kaido, Luffy has just used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:53.460
his gear5 form in his fight with Lucci. nd yes&nbsp;
he has successfully beaten Lucci a second time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:58.380
and even though Lucci clearly has become very&nbsp;
powerful himself, he couldn’t even touch Luffy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:05.100
But we also see that Luffy has turned into that&nbsp;
old man form again after using his awakening.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:11.160
Clearly gear 5 is draining Luffy of his energy&nbsp;
and I’m not sure if he would be able to simply&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:18.780
reactivate it again if Kizaru popped up. However&nbsp;
all the other straw hats are well rested. Zoro and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:24.300
Sanji definitely could put up a real fight this&nbsp;
time. And on top of that, we have also seen a pair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:30.420
of gloves in Vegapunk’s lab that makes it possible&nbsp;
to touch light. Plus an actual light saber that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:37.920
Bonney picked up. So, it does seem like Oda has&nbsp;
set up a fight with admiral Kizaru for SOMEBODY.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:43.560
But on top of this epic set up for Kizaru and&nbsp;
his grand armada, we also had some other major&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:50.160
stuff happening: Luffy’s battle with Lucci&nbsp;
was absolutely epic and really fun to read,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:55.440
we got a bunch of new gear 5 attacks and a ton&nbsp;
of references to their first fight during enies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.440 --> 00:08:00.120
lobby. Some of the panels were designed in the&nbsp;
exact same way, like this one from last chapter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:07.320
and this time Lucci also thinks to himself that&nbsp;
his consciousness is fading, just like on enis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:13.440
lobby. I think the fight was more something to&nbsp;
just enjoy. Not really to discuss in depth here.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:18.960
I really liked that Lucci was super strong and&nbsp;
didn’t go down right away, but still couldn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:25.200
lay a finger on Luffy, who now finally gets the&nbsp;
respect a Yonko deserves. The biggest takeaway of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:30.900
the fight, is that the 3 seraphim who were&nbsp;
in the lab have now also gone over to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:35.400
government’s side. Though it was really nice&nbsp;
seeing them fight as an ally here for a bit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:42.060
I also really like that the seraphim can actually&nbsp;
talk and have some real personality too. That not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:47.700
only makes them terrifying weapons, but actual&nbsp;
characters that can be talked to and interacted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:53.220
with. It might well be that Luffy will free them&nbsp;
from the government control too at some point. Or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:59.700
maybe vegapunk has secretly inserted Dragon as&nbsp;
their supreme commander on top of the Gorosei.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:06.060
And then we also had even more lore drop on&nbsp;
Vegapunk’s aritificial devil fruits. He confirms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:11.520
that different categories of devil fruits&nbsp;
are differently easy or hard to copy. Zoans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:16.260
as we already guessed are the easiest, because&nbsp;
they are literally based on animals. Paramecia&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:21.120
fruits require dna from the user, which is&nbsp;
known as the lineage factor in one piece.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:27.660
And logia fruit users are basically impossible to&nbsp;
copy. They just really like being the most unique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:32.700
category of furuits huh. This of course explains&nbsp;
why the jinbei seraphim has the swim swim fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:39.120
after Doflamingo and his crew were captured by&nbsp;
the marines. It’s very likely there is a dofi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:42.720
seraphim with his string fruit powers&nbsp;
as well. And it might also explain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:48.360
why shanks insisted on taking ace’s and&nbsp;
whitebeards body away from marineford. To&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:56.160
keep the government from stealing his power’s too.&nbsp;
If anyone knows about this, it’s shanks after all.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:10:00.660
And speaking of the linage factor and devil&nbsp;
fruit experiments, we have to talk about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:06.420
cover of this chapter too, where we see young&nbsp;
versions of doctor vegapunk, a slim queen, an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:14.040
emo ceasar and a really quirky looking judge. Love&nbsp;
these designs. But it stood out to me that judge&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:21.600
doesn’T have sanji’s spirally eyebrows, nor does&nbsp;
his mother. So the idea that sanji has received&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:27.180
some sort of devil fruit ability from the lineage&nbsp;
factor experiments on him seems to have gotten a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:33.600
bit more proof. That’s because his eyebrow has&nbsp;
the same spiral shape as those on devil fruits.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:37.200
We have gotten so much knowledge on devil fruits&nbsp;
and their awakening these last few chapters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:41.460
that as promised, i have condensed&nbsp;
everything we know into this video,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:44.760
if you would like to get an overview.&nbsp;
Thanks so much for watching.

